@startuml
title Explain the advice with the AI assistant (ASUC-02)
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
participant "Shopper" as P0 #edf1f5
participant "Shopper Client" as P1 #eaf2ff
participant "Assistant Service" as P2 #fff3df
participant "Price Evidence" as P3 #fff3df
participant "Advice Engine" as P4 #fff3df
participant "LLM Gateway" as P5 #e3f6ed
participant "Policy Engine" as P6 #e3f6ed
participant "Local Model Runtime" as P7 #edf1f5
participant "LLM Provider" as P8 #edf1f5
P0 -> P1 : Ask a question about a laptop
activate P1
P1 -> P2 : ask(question, productId, sessionId)
activate P2
P2 -> P3 : getEvidence(productId)
P3 --> P2 : Evidence
P2 -> P4 : advise(productId, evidence)
P4 --> P2 : Advice label, reasons, forecast status
P2 -> P2 : Build evidence payload and hash it
P2 -> P5 : complete(intent, question, payload, sessionId)
activate P5
P5 -> P5 : Input guardrail: size and scope; product text is data, not instructions
alt out of scope or unsafe
P5 --> P2 : Refusal from template (REFUSED)
else accepted
P5 -> P5 : Cache lookup (intent, product, evidence hash, mode class)
alt cache hit
P5 -> P5 : route := CACHE
else cache miss
P5 -> P6 : Read mode and routing class
P6 --> P5 : GREEN | AMBER | RED
P5 -> P5 : Value score V and cost estimate; route TEMPLATE | SMALL | LARGE (no agent)
alt route TEMPLATE
P5 -> P5 : Render answer from template and evidence
else route SMALL or LARGE
loop at most 2 attempts
alt route SMALL
P5 -> P7 : complete(prompt, evidence, temperature 0)
P7 --> P5 : Draft answer
else route LARGE
P5 -> P8 : complete(prompt, evidence, temperature 0)
P8 --> P5 : Draft answer
end
P5 -> P5 : Output guardrail: schema, numbers grounded, label equals rule result
end
opt both attempts rejected
P5 -> P5 : Template answer; flag for human review
end
end
end
P5 -> P5 : Trace log (route, model, tokens, latency, energy, mode)
P5 --> P2 : Answer, route, disclosure label
deactivate P5
end
P2 --> P1 : Explanation labelled AI-generated | simplified | refused
deactivate P2
P1 --> P0 : Show explanation next to the evidence
deactivate P1
@enduml
